--- !u!114 &1324078715
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1324078713}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2ba7f8c21df8f2748b007509b09ab81e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subjectText: {fileID: 1324078716}
  descText: {fileID: 693307527}
  subjects:
  - Wind Fortress
  - Scorch Station
  - Mrs C
  - Tartarus
  - The Bloodways
  - Matrioshka Space
  - SENTINEL
  - ZELUS
  - C>_ENTINEL
  - Utterances
  descriptions:
  - The lowest level of the entire city. The infamous site was used for surveillance
    and Mrs C's security.
  - Prometheum is a strange substance, capable of impossible things. However, its
    primal state is much more volatile, and can only be used to power superstructures.
  - '"Mrs C is quite possibly the most astonishing work of construction ever achieved.
    Powered by her own creations, she is capable of producing any form; organic or
    mechanical. One can only imagine the wonders possible..."'
  - What happened? Why am I here? I can't be here. She is there. There is malice
    here. I can't be here. I can't be here.
  - For bulk production of Prometheum, vast pipeways were required. Now that the
    city is empty, such things have rotted and been left to stagnation. What's left
    isn't pretty.
  - '"Clones were always a special concoction. Its unknown what truly goes on in
    its mind, or how such a minute creature could result in something so powerful..."'
  - 'Sentinels were special operatives that tended to the city.                      
    The Mother Computer did not control them, but they were slaves to a different
    influence: Loyalty.'
  - Once a drone created by Mrs C, mutated and transformed by Prometheum into a energy
    parasite. It has no mind; It seeks only to destroy.
  - Once a Sentinel, now a puppet of a much more malevolent force. Strike them down!
  - 'YE TREMBLING AND SNIVELING THINGS; ALL HAVE COMPLETED UTTER CRIME. EXTINGUISH,
    AND RETURN TO ME. '
  debugText: 0
  bossAggro: 0
